 "seen": "Satellite z19 mosaic (0.237 m/px) of the park west of the department store: the park lies between 길주로 (north, elevated road) and the public parking lot (south), east of the west road and west of the road beside the store. A straight light-stone axis runs from the NW corner entrance SE through a round plaza to the statue court; a red-brown block loop walk circles a playground, the round plaza and an amphitheatre with a D-shaped stage; a long sloping banded plaza leads down to the statue on a round platform in a square court with four corner beds; a white wall on a raised terrace sits SW of the statue. Woods (dense trees) fill the west, south and east edges; lawn with tree rows in the north. Street view from the east road: grey block entrance walk, boxwood hedges on granite-edged beds, pines, red brick walk and a small brick hut with dark roof, black low railing at the curb. News photo (ceremony 2022): bronze standing figure on a pale granite pedestal in a wide light grey paved plaza. Not located: the 2016 girl statue/comic-art memorial (3.7 x 1.8 m panel work with LED) and inscription stones mentioned by a visitor page; likely near the statue court or the white wall, not visible from above. Benches not resolvable at this resolution. Trees are left to trees.py.",
